{"synopsis":"Lee Do-hyeok kembali ke masa lalu untuk menyelamatkan dunia. Ia disuruh mempersiapkan diri sebaik mungkin.\n\nNamun… dunia tidak kiamat. Kini yang tersisa bagi Do-hyeok hanyalah segunung utang.\n\n“Aku akan membayarmu gaji, jadi bantu aku dengan streaming game-ku!”\n\n… Maka, ia pun mulai melakukan streaming game. Namun, entah mengapa, itu terlalu mudah?\n\nSaksikan debut mantan pahlawan sebagai streamer game!","alternative_title":"회귀했는데 세상이 안 망함","author":"Son Byeong-jun (손병준), Seonwoo (선우)","artist":"NemGa (넴가)","chapters":[{"number":"63","chapter":"63","slug":"ea7534e0-96ca-48b5-8744-fc501922fb77","title":"Chapter 63","date":"2026-05-11"},{"number":"62","chapter":"62","slug":"96b9596f-b4c5-463d-b319-a21f77af2bb0","title":"Chapter 62","date":"2026-05-11"},{"number":"61","chapter":"61","slug":"79fb634e-89e3-4a04-b6ec-05e8a9a5747f","title":"Chapter 61","date":"2026-05-02"},{"number":"60","chapter":"60","slug":"3c637f90-3f8b-4953-bd47-4c08cec3cb2a","title":"Chapter 60","date":"2026-04-19"},{"number":"59","chapter":"59","slug":"e54fccc3-66ff-4d1f-921c-ab92b32cdeea","title":"Chapter 59","date":"2026-04-15"},{"number":"58","chapter":"58","slug":"7f50d969-4901-4f08-9875-5a932f073660","title":"Chapter 58","date":"2026-04-09"},{"number":"57","chapter":"57","slug":"1bb49089-d02a-41bb-bcaf-f9ba4526f988","title":"Chapter 57","date":"2026-04-08"},{"number":"56","chapter":"56","slug":"e3ad8c36-b360-424a-a495-7a4b0310d7f4","title":"Chapter 56","date":"2026-04-08"},{"number":"55","chapter":"55","slug":"983d1bef-1209-4765-95a0-bd30e0a16e2e","title":"Chapter 55","date":"2026-04-08"},{"number":"54","chapter":"54","slug":"29cd495d-bda7-46a9-9858-7ba3633c5611","title":"Chapter 54","date":"2026-04-08"},{"number":"53","chapter":"53","slug":"4bf96f6b-87a1-440c-b504-dd3a0d9f93e4","title":"Chapter 53","date":"2026-02-18"},{"number":"52","chapter":"52","slug":"92a8e93f-23aa-4b1e-aa01-14177d684d20","title":"Chapter 52","date":"2026-02-03"},{"number":"51","chapter":"51","slug":"8